@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
[*] --> Capture
Capture --> Validate
Validate --> AssignID : valid
AssignID --> Encrypt
Encrypt --> Queue : AEAD before write
Queue --> NetworkCheck
NetworkCheck --> Upload : available
NetworkCheck --> Backoff : unavailable
Backoff --> NetworkCheck : retry
Upload --> Ack
Ack --> Synced : idempotent commit
@enduml
